  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You disappear into a hazy shroud of haunting visions.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Haunted Gnome Shroud<sup>UC</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> The miss chance granted by Haunted Gnome Shroud increases to 50%. You can see through haunting mists that you create and are never harmed by them. While under the effect of haunted fey aspect, you may spend one point of mythic power as a swift action to become incorporeal for a number of rounds equal to one-half your mythic tier (minimum 1) or until the haunted fey aspect ends, whichever comes first.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-a-m-feats#toc167\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
